            "created_at": "2025-09-04T22:00:04.945891+00:00",
            "notes": "[Recursion Battery](item_88c3fb1a-2d38-4d2c-b439-6aadd038fd1a) is SUPER important if you don't want to die in the later rounds when you can get kills.\nI like pairing it up with [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) because the 50% lifesteal can give 100 extra overhealth on max hp, which I feel is a lot more beneficial than [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) here.\n\nFor the rest of the items, build ability power and ability lifesteal to increase the effectiveness of your mini barrages.\n\nThis is the round where you should start getting kills and winning, since you can now survive with your mini barrages long enough to delete the enemy team (you still have to play behind cover/walls to not die to hitscan)",
